  "A fit for Mosh, network diagnostics, VPN-over-SSH, and Proxmox workflows, with a one-time Pro purchase.": "Mosh、ネットワーク診断、VPN-over-SSH、Proxmoxを使う方に。Proは買い切りで購入できます。",
  "Free for one saved connection": "1件の接続保存まで無料",
